<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge rises to 68.6870 per dollar.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge rises to 68.6870 per dollar.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge rose to 68.6870 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange from 68.7253 on Monday.</p>
<p>				    Sep 10		  Sep 9</p>
<p> tenge per dollar	     68.6870		 68.7253</p>
<p> volume ($ million)	     3.155		   3.025</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
